sequenceDiagram
  actor A as Admin
  participant AR as AdminRoute
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  actor U as User
  participant FR as ForumRoute

  A->>AR: POST/PATCH/DELETE /admin/forum/announcements
  AR->>DB: 写 forum_announcements
  AR->>DB: 写 audit_logs
  U->>FR: GET /forum/announcements
  FR->>DB: 读取可展示公告
  DB-->>FR: announcements
  FR-->>U: 公告列表
